 "provenance": "Bavaria 12 (secret stage, world 1 level 11): secret exit 56,5 from the spawn, control-only on the exact S700 core (paint-every-frame harness), no damage, no deaths, no resets. Start values: weaponTier 2 (hook from the Bavaria 3 chest 24,25; Bavaria secret stages are reached after Bavaria 8), maxHealth 4 (no armor), lives 12 (campaign value used by the earlier routes), diamonds/redDiamonds 0 (per-stage HUD; the stage's own 86 diamonds open the magic lock), diving true (diving item from the Bavaria 8 riddle chest 20,12; the route swims in the pool 18-22,12 to push the floating stone; without it the hero cannot enter the water). Route: walk-in, break the brick column at x=2, cross the spike corridor on row 5 (7 diamonds), checkpoint 1 at 27,6. Room: push stone S2 to 5,14 and hit bridge switch 10,16 (S2 blows the mines and opens 3,16, S3 falls to 10,15); hook S1 7,11->9,11->11,11; hit switch 4,16 from 3,16; hook S1 to 13,11, 15,11, 17,11 and from 20,11 to 19,11, where it drops into the pool and floats at 19,12; swim in from 18,12 and push it 19->20->21->22->23,12; step into grass 24,12 (the pool's row 12 drains), then push S1 23->24->25,12 so it falls onto plate 25,13 (gate 0 stays open). Chests 29,12 (25 diamonds), 30,11 (silver key), 31,12 (red diamond); silver lock 29,4 opens gate 1; checkpoint 2 at 31,5. Spike row 32-47,4 crossed by timing the spikes (cGame.method_264/method_323; a 1426-tick wait at 39,4 for the 40/41 pair), 4 diamonds. Past the two red snakes to checkpoint 3 at 51,7; break brick cluster at 37,9, hook stone 36,9 to 38,10, 40,10, 42,10, push it into the pocket 43,11, hit the cluster at 47,10, hook it 43->45->46->48->50,11 so it falls onto plate 50,12 (gate 4 open); chests 54,11 (50 diamonds) and 55,10 (gold key); back past the snakes to gold lock 54,4 (gate 5 opens); with 86 diamonds the magic diamond lock 55,5 (85) is open; walk 53,5->54,5->55,5->56,5 to the secret exit.",
